        "secondary_description": "<p>Uncompromising durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the structural integrity and aesthetic finish of the Multiderm (5 in 1), regular sanitization with hospital-grade surface disinfectants formulated for clinical environments must be executed daily. The heavy-duty exterior casing offers high chemical resistance, ensuring an immaculate condition outcome across an extended multi-year operational timeframe. Consistent care preserves electrical connectivity, guards against fluid ingress, and guarantees long-term mechanical reliability.</p>",
